Package: ehome
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: web
Priority: optional
Depends: tomcat10 (>= 10.1), java17-runtime-headless
Maintainer: Bernhard Haumacher <bhu@top-logic.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/haumacher/ehome
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: E-Home, engineering of KNX and Zigbee installations
 A TopLogic web application that imports KNX ETS projects, discovers KNX
 gateways, programs devices and deploys rules and schedules to HomeControl
 controllers.
 .
 The application runs in Tomcat 10 at http://<host>:8080/ehome/view/ and keeps
 its H2 database and data in /var/lib/ehome. Settings, including the initial
 password of the administrator root, are in /etc/ehome/ehome.env.
